# Optional — only needed for the "Add AI coach notes" toggle on the Plan
# page. Without these, plan generation still works fully; the toggle just
# shows a message that AI notes aren't configured. Get a free key at
# https://openrouter.ai/keys — no card required for :free-tier models.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_MODEL=openrouter/free
